            "review_title": "Review at Han's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "DuyJungle\nNha Trang, Vietnam362 contributions\n1\nOur Guests love it\nOct 2019\nWe have been there and now take our guests there and recommend it to them. Best thing ever happened to use they Love it. Good value for money and friendly people. Cost of food and drinks is less than in the main tourist area, 150 meters away. They have just put in a big TV screen and show all the top sporting events. 8,000 VND a beer !\nTry the set lunch for 99,000 VND Go for the fresh fish option, you will not be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 29, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
