            "review_title": "Review at Han's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "viet1\nNha Trang, Vietnam10442 contributions\n0\nGreat new restaurant\nOct 2019\nWatched this place being built as it is near my house. Turned out really good, well designed and fresh looking. Has 2 floors and is very open, good for people watching. Food is a mix of Vietnamese and Western, very fresh. Excellent chef and have never had a bad meal there. They do some very interesting salads that you should give a try. Soups and burgers also very nice. Staff are friendly and helpful, free wi-fi and a beer with your main meal. Prices are inexpensive and 20 to 40% cheaper than other nearby restaurants. Not to be missed.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 25, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
