            "review_text": "Julie B\nChesterfield7 contributions\n2\nGreat Place, great people.\nAug 2019 • Couples\nJust dropped on this place by accident during a walk around the streets of Nha Trang and wanted (needed) a beer. We were so impressed by the staff, food and prices we came back 6 times.\n\nReally nice people, took impromptu lessons in Vietnamese, while drinking bottles of Beer at 10,000 each for 450ml, (£0.35p) not sure how good our pronunciation was after 7 beers each but it was fun.\nRead more\nWritten September 20, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
