            "review_text": "Scotsman_HMFC\nBrisbane, Australia28 contributions\n3\nFantastic new eating place in Nha Trang\nSep 2019\nNew building 2 months ago, Hans Restaurant has everything I need.\nFantastic Vietnamese cuisine and beer at very cheap prices. \nIt also has a full range of western food, so if you want a hamburger and chips - you can have that too.\nI liked the openness of the place and particularly liked sitting upstairs, looking down on the main street.\nStaff were friendly and spoke English too - actually surprised this place is not mobbed - although I figure it is only time.\nPerhaps one issue for a new build Restaurant, is there is no disabled access as the toilets are upstairs (and real nice they are too) - unfortunately this is a common theme in Vietnam,\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 13, 2019",
